  "slug": "syncora-support-missing-voucher-report",
  "title": "How to Report a Missing Voucher So Support Can Trace It",
  "description": "Collect the exact voucher identifier, search filters, connector version and sync time for a useful support request.",
  "category": "Sync troubleshooting",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Build a one-voucher example",
      "body": "Record the company, date, type and number from TallyPrime. Add the party or amount if the number is reused. Start with one voucher that reliably reproduces the issue rather than sending a full ledger."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Include the conditions that matter",
      "body": "Write down the financial year and date range you used in Syncora, along with the connector version and last successful sync time. Name the device or browser where you observed it. If you tried the same lookup in another view, include what changed."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Share the minimum evidence",
      "body": "A redacted screenshot of the missing result and the source voucher details is usually more useful than a large export. Remove access tokens, passwords and unrelated customer details. Send the information through the Syncora support channel."
    }
  ],
  "relatedPaths": [
    "/guides/tally-sync-troubleshooting",
    "/support"
  ]
}
